      <td class="newshead">Another week...</td>
      <td width="18" rowspan="3" background="/images/news_right.jpg">&nbsp;</td>
      </tr><tr>
      <td class="newsfliesstext">and more loot from our daily raiding.  Let's see...nothing too eventful happened this week, just the usual for the most part.  We did DT, HoS, Lyceum, Labs and Telendor.  <br />
<br />
Just a few pieces of random loot from the list this week:<br />
<br />
<div align="center"><img src="http://the-forgotten.net/newspics/newspics/Midseptloot.JPG"></div><br />
<br />
Somehow we ran across even more relic drops than usual.  We must have had at least 40 pieces of Relic chain in a row at one point...it was just odd. So grats to the guild bank on that.  We even got a few master spells that people could actually use this week as well as many to spare for the guild bank yet again.  :)<br />
<br />
We did have one chest get stuck in the middle of a wall up high that belonged to Lord Vyemm.  We tried to knockback into it, everyone was jumping around using their Gnomish spring boots (and I was too busy laughing at my guildmates flying about to take a screenshot) but in the end we just could not get it.  I so miss Levitate sometimes.  Galatee was so kind to help us out tho...<br />
<br />
<br />
<div align="center"><img src="http://the-forgotten.net/newspics/newspics/gm.JPG"></div><br />
<br />
...s/he offered us two 2-Handers (SOE just loves 2-Handers lately).<br />
<br />
too bad we could not loot him and get some nice loot (even for a lvl 1) like:<br />
<br />
<br />
<div align="center"><img src="http://the-forgotten.net/newspics/newspics/gm2.JPG"></div><br />
<br />
...and<br />
<br />
<div align="center"><img src="http://the-forgotten.net/newspics/newspics/gm3.JPG"></div><br />
<br />
I so want my next familiar to look like that bracer graphic. :P In the mean time I will show you our new mascot.<br />
<br />
<div align="center"><img src="http://the-forgotten.net/newspics/newspics/Upet.JPG"></div><br />
<br />
Isn't he adorable?  He makes funny sounds when you mess with him too. <br />
<br />
So, until next week have fun and enjoy.<br />
<br />
<div align="center"><img src="http://the-forgotten.net/newspics/newspics/emote.JPG"></div><br />
<br />
...you are in OUR world now! (so beware of the bards)   ;)</td>
