      <td width="1" rowspan="3" background="/images/news_left.jpg">&nbsp;</td>
      <td class="newshead">Chel'Drak the Ancient Lord invited us to his lair...</td>
      <td width="18" rowspan="3" background="/images/news_right.jpg">&nbsp;</td>
      </tr><tr>
      <td class="newsfliesstext">So, we decided to go and introduce ourselves.  What can I say, we always  love to meet new dragons!<br />
<br />
<div align="center"><img src="http://the-forgotten.net/newspics/newspics/chamberentry.JPG"></div><br />
<br />
<div align="center"><img src="http://the-forgotten.net/newspics/newspics/lair.JPG"></div><br />
<br />
He was kind of cute peaking out of his little cave.<br />
<br />
<div align="center"><img src="http://the-forgotten.net/newspics/newspics/Chel.JPG"></div><br />
<br />
...but then he got rather annoyed when I wanted to take his picture and he not only ate me for my blond moment of charging in unannounced but he was moody it seems and decided to eat the whole guild too.<br />
<br />
You just never can trust a dragon these days...I guess he prefers us to knock before entering his home.<br />
<br />
<br />
<div align="center"><img src="http://the-forgotten.net/newspics/newspics/Chelbig.JPG"></div><br />
<br />
Oops (as I said, Moody).<br />
<br />
<div align="center"><img src="http://the-forgotten.net/newspics/newspics/dead.JPG"></div><br />
<br />
<br />
Well, anyway it was only a fast and fearless test today, we do plan to give him a serious try next week with a larger force (and with me being a more innocent news reporter and staying behind the tank) and maybe soon we can add him into our weekly farming targets along with DT, HoS, Lyceum, Labs, Roost, Crab, AoA Dragons, etc.  <br />
<br />
So stay tuned and have a great weekend.  :)</td>
